OL,3,ABraid-creator Jonathan Blow on making
OL,4,Athe 'biggest puzzle game ever'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSo why make something the majority of
OL,7,Fplayers may never get even halfway
OL,8,Fthrough, let alone finish?
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/19
